WEBVTT

00:07:27.276 --> 00:07:32.031
(Applause)

00:07:32.031 --> 00:07:36.285
By the way, most think nuclear
energy waste looks like this.

00:07:37.077 --> 00:07:39.121
It actually looks like this.

00:07:40.289 --> 00:07:45.544
Fully contained in concrete casks
that are so good at blocking radiation

00:07:45.586 --> 00:07:47.379
I might do a photo shoot there.

00:07:48.547 --> 00:07:52.218
Now, a more modern objection
to nuclear power

00:07:52.259 --> 00:07:54.720
is that it's too slow.

00:07:54.762 --> 00:07:57.139
It takes too long to build.

00:07:58.224 --> 00:08:02.019
Well, I'm sure Isodope has something
to say about that.